menu "Debug Console (GATT)"

config DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT
    bool "Enable Debug Console over BLE GATT"
    default n
    help
      Enable the BLE GATT-based debug console for remote shell access.
      This console uses a custom 128-bit UUID service for RX/TX characteristics.

config DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT_ENCRYPTED
    bool "Require pairing (encryption) for Console GATT RX"
    depends on DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT
    default y
    help
      When enabled, writes to the console RX characteristic require an encrypted link.
      Unpaired writes will trigger pairing and be rejected until encryption is established.
      Bonds persist across reboots via NVS storage.

config DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT_INPUT
    bool "Enable BLE GATT as console input (CHIP shell)"
    depends on DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT
    default y
    help
      When enabled, BLE GATT RX writes are processed as CHIP shell commands.
      Commands are executed with the same mutex as UART to prevent conflicts.

config DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT_TEE_LOGS
    bool "Tee ESP logs/printf to BLE console"
    depends on DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT
    default y
    help
      When enabled, ESP_LOG* output is mirrored to BLE console TX in addition to UART.
      Uses non-blocking ring-buffer to prevent BLE from slowing down logging.

config DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT_APPEND_CRLF
    bool "Append CRLF on newline for BLE console"
    depends on DEBUG_CONSOLE_GATT
    default y
    help
      When enabled, appends both CR and LF on newline for better BLE terminal compatibility.
      Disable to send only LF (Unix-style).

endmenu
